<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">Hi there,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">It's been a little while since we last spoke, so I wanted to reach out to you to see if you are ready to expand upon your current portfolio.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Our acquisitions team has knocked it out of the park the last 90 days or so, so I've gotten some really nice new properties this week. I will attach a few to this email for you to take a look.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you haven't already taken a look at our 2 newest markets, Oklahoma City and Little Rock, then you are missing the boat! These two markets are currently kicking out some of our best properties.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Prices are slowly going up in all five markets, as are interest rates, so your buying power is stronger today than it likely will be 6-12 months from now, so if you are ready to rock and roll and want to expand your portfolio, please use the link below to schedule a call with me asap.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You can also text me at 901-481-6842 if you are interested in jumping on one of the properties attached to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thanks,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br>Marq</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bea0-baba97f6-16a5bdc5-baba97f6-00000003-akh1jtljgb2avjcra3athdno4hnubpbd&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><img src="https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/VocC3c2w1i6HUluWpOvtxOAa5qF2zGJEuSJO-lUHv6cCFTVdcsZfyi4asNB_Zq6julHgKskY6uTvxhB6lEaov2si393M4vZBlKNwFgfd6_dBzQwV-TBsgIlJSImkDO4E0DqWebkrX65tQZyx0nwNdYOKo6fSj4okMuw5hwZNj4BUrTREXVFbJTWicYLRAP8cbRjkBqMHVgRqEgNuCrbi6A=s0-d-e1-ft#https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1uTcA6Utb6kWjhoLr2_vrSEJZXYzTeHGo&amp;revid=0B6FqHnQBLWozL3pMbWZoTzBOZlJyTFZkK1oveDYydDN1MWxNPQ" width="420" height="275"></a><br><div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 1.5pt;"><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"><table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse;"><colgroup><col width="209"><col width="217"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: georgia, serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 0pt;"><td style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><br></p></td><td style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt;"><br></td></tr><tr style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: georgia, serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 0pt;"></tr></tbody></table></div></div>]]></td>
